From 8a268997434653258446ddb036b2f170c024fc3a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 17:32:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Rename TeddyCloud to CrewCloud in the UI, new app icons

- Translations (en/de/fr/es) generated by crewcloud-rebrand.py: product name in user-visible text becomes CrewCloud; references to the upstream TeddyCloud project (community, wiki, forum, contributors, sponsoring, releases, support requests) keep its name. Teddy-branded features get plain names (Playlists, Label studio), Audio Encoder becomes Add audio. Adds the crewcloud.* strings.
- Page title, home-screen name and manifest; favicon, Apple and Android (maskable) icons; audio player fallback art.
- viewport-fit=cover so the header and tab bar respect the notch and home indicator when installed on a phone.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VdeEDs6BS9YupCSmfGg7F8
